From 086348d4149fcaf98ca39824ea7c583f4255f8cc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 12:13:25 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] logging: structure inherited coin-statistics index
 diagnostics

Convert ten inherited index diagnostics without changing state updates,
return values or levels. WARNING prose remains at its original Info level.
Copy real BlockHash values, signed heights and the original ASCII key byte;
render strings on the logger thread through the existing typed adapters.

Scripted diff (ast-grep-py 0.51.0, reviewed exact argument catalog):
  /private/tmp/lane-n4-build/logging-compose/ast-venv/bin/python contrib/logging/conversion/convert.py --root . --rules contrib/logging/conversion/rules/coinstats-shared-diagnostics.json --report /Users/shammah/repos/lotus-v2-repair-work/logging-cleanup/coinstats-shared-204-apply.json --apply
  git clang-format --force --binary /opt/homebrew/bin/clang-format --style '{BasedOnStyle: InheritParentConfig, BreakStringLiterals: false}' HEAD -- src/index/coinstatsindex.cpp

Tier: shared eCash. The native accounting/expiry diagnostics remain a separate
V2 owner. Actual state-corruption JSON regression is supplied with that later
V2 test fixture; it uses the already-existing V2 CoinStatsIndexTestAccess
friend, rather than adding a production API for logging tests.

Validation at commit: event lint412 production sites and whitespace pass.
Native gates pending for this source checkpoint; first194 immutable native
checkpoint remains unchanged. No public registry/header changes.
---
